    m_Localized: The screwdriver snapped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296662
    m_Localized: TIP: Use hiding spots to escape enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296663
    m_Localized: TIP: Explore carefully, you might find important clues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296664
    m_Localized: TIP: Keep quiet, enemies can hear you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296665
    m_Localized: TIP: Your flashlight has limited battery, use it wisely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296666
    m_Localized: TIP: Some doors require special keys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296667
    m_Localized: TIP: Running can attract enemies' attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296668
    m_Localized: TIP: Read notes and documents to uncover the story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296669
